      "Tier-B environment audit resolved all 28 M001 declarations; axiom profile was 26x {propext, Quot.sound}, 1x {propext}, 1x empty; Classical.choice and sorry were absent.",
      "Exhaustive Python cross-layer probe over 99 reachable states on (b,L)={(2,2),(2,3),(3,2),(4,1),(2,4),(3,3)} found zero deviations for exact port membership, bornness, ordered partition, carrier coverage and unborn-child exclusion.",
      "Lean proves BirthLocalPort bornness and boundary membership iff BirthLocalPort, closing the earlier filter-completeness gap."
